{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/PNG_Text_FIX_-_Reach_Princess.png?t=1753044106\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Gif_neu_-_jump_knight_princess.gif?t=1753044106\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knight Jump - 60 Minutes to Hell and Back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 3D precision platformer, but you only got 60 minutes. Inspired by the classic skill (frustration) games like &quot;Jump King&quot; or &quot;Only Up&quot;!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't adjust midair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And if you fail: Your safe file gets deleted!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/PNG_Text_400_-_Hell_soul.png?t=1753044106\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Gif_neu_-_jump_knight_hell.gif?t=1753044106\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It won't be easy, because the Horrors of the depth are chasing you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump out of Hell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid the darkness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And don't die (Pro Advice)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/PNG_Text_400_-_Take_Rest.png?t=1753044106\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Gif_neu_-_jump_knight_rest.gif?t=1753044106\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse different worlds until you reach the princess!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 different levels. One harder than the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Gif_Neu_-_Knight_Jump_Graveyard.gif?t=1753044106\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Have fun with this little (Horror) 3D Plattformer and maybe help me feed my Cat! :)</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/Cat_with_Knight_3.4.1.jpg?t=1753044106\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705570?t=1753044106","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/37dca8b2eb788c966c9d229ae4958870d25c1fa6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753044106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/7fb1c6d865fc8f65ff4acf0940356e11593d3642/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753044106","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/7fb1c6d865fc8f65ff4acf0940356e11593d3642/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753044106","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3758210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705570/extras/PNG_Text_FIX_-_Reach_Princess.png?t=1753044106\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\